# Trunk-based merges with actual regression evidence

- Work on branch from up-to-date main, small traceable changes, tests before merge; never force-push main or overwrite concurrent work.
- Ensure npm run check, npm test, Node.js 22/24 CI, Rust Ratatui installer and relevant FFmpeg/MCP/OAuth/viewport regressions. Call out unavailable smoke checks.
- Test one-use OAuth codes, public admin isolation, SSRF, browser login status and secure storage for changes that touch those areas.
- Setup must preserve existing .env secrets, accounts, database and user choices. Make optional integrations discoverable, not mandatory if not needed.
- Green CI does not prove Cloudflare tunnel or the user's Mac launchd daemon is running, the model is downloaded, Suno generated audio, or ChatGPT plugin installed.
- Respect uncommitted local worktree files; avoid destructive reset. Separate macOS environment verification from repository test passes.
